## Errors from the parts of Schelf that open apps, windows and links

desktop-only-web-links = Only web links can be opened.
desktop-not-started = The app didn't start.
desktop-app-gone = That app isn't installed any more.
# When renaming an app
desktop-names-app-gone = This app isn't installed anymore.
desktop-window-closed = This window has already closed.

## Choosing a file or folder for an app

desktop-choose-folder = Choose a folder
desktop-choose-icon = Choose an icon
desktop-choose-symbolic-icon = Choose a symbolic icon
# Kinds of file to choose from
desktop-images = Images
desktop-svg-images = SVG images
